A. chemical_spill_kit_tbl

Master inventory — isang record bawat kit.
- chemical_spill_kit_id — Primary key
- chemical_spill_kit_code — QR code
- branch — Branch
- archived — Active o archived


B. chemical_spill_kit_inspection_tbl

Inspection header — isang record bawat inspection session.
- inspection_id — Primary key
- chemical_spill_kit_id — Kit na in-inspect
- branch — Branch noong inspection
- inspected_by — Inspector ID
- inspection_date — Petsa ng inspection


C. chemical_spill_kit_checklist_tbl

Inspection details — isang record bawat material.
- checklist_id — Primary key
- inspection_id — Parent inspection
- material_name — Pangalan ng material
- status — Good / No Good
- remarks — Remarks ng material


D. transactions_tbl — existing

Approval workflow. Hindi na kailangan ng hiwalay na transaction table para sa Chemical Spill Kit.
- transaction_id — Primary key
- transaction_type — Inspection transaction type
- category — Chemical Spill Kit category
- inspection_id — ID ng inspection
- branch — Branch
- status — Pending / Approved / Rejected
- submitted_by, submitted_at
- reviewed_by, reviewed_at
- rejection_reason